//FAM B — DAY 1 — GARDENING TOOLS (PRISTINE / SLIGHTLY DAMAGED)
title: FamB
when: ($day == 1) && ($package == "gardenTools") && ($packageState == "Pristine" || $packageState == "SlightlyDamaged")
color: blue
group: FamB && Day1
position: -852,-882
---
//FAM B — DAY 1 — GARDENING TOOLS (PRISTINE / SLIGHTLY DAMAGED)
Mailman: Good afternoon, is Mikkel Andersen here?
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: Yes, that would be my husband. I'll just go get him, come in if you'd like. 
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
-> Mailman: No thank you, I'll just wait out here.
    <<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
    Gertrude: Alright, he'll be right out.
    <<hideCharacter "Gertrude">>
    *Mrs.Andersen leaves and Mr.Andersen comes*
    <<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
    Mail man: Mr.Andersen, I've got a package for you, if you could sign here?
    <<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingTired">>
    Mikkel: Sure thing.
    <<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
    Mail man: Thank you, have a lovely evening.
    <<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingTired">>
    Mikkel: You too.
    <<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
-> Mailman: Oh, thank you! It's pretty warm out here.
    <<jump BEn1Day1>>
===

title: BEn1Day1
group: FamB && Day1
position: -587,-882
---
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: Dangerous heat for us old folks, huh?. Poor you having to work in this weather, how many years until you retire?
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "Worried">>
Mail man: Oh I'm already retired. I just couldn't stay at home doing nothing all day.
//*You walk into the living room where Mr.Andersen is at*
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: Same here! Mikkel here barely leaves the house. Half of our friends have passed away, and the rest can't make it up the stairs anymore.
<<showCharater "Gertrude" "Worried">>
-> Mailman: Haha, I know the feeling. That's why I became a mailman! But I'm always up for a bit of fishing if you ever feel like it.
<<jump BEnd1Day1>>
-> Mailman: Yeah, I know… that's why I needed something to keep busy.
<<jump BEnd2Day1>>
===

title: BEnd1Day1
group: FamB && Day1
color: green
position: -331,-811
---
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingTired">>
Mikkel: I might take you up on that offer some time. For now I'll just keep gardening. What reminds me, do you have my package?
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "Worried">>
Mailman: Oh right, sorry! I just need you to sign right here.
<<showCharacter "Mikkel" "TalkingTired">>
Mikkel: Thanks! Our kids ordered them online, I wasn't sure they'd even arrive.
<<showCharacter "Gertrude" "TalkingWorried">>
Gertrude: You thought they were scammers!!
<<showCharacter "Gertrude">>
Mailman: Well, can't be too careful! Thank you for letting me in. See you another time.

Mikkel: Thank you for not robbing us!

Gertrude: Come back anytime for some tea!

===

