//FAM C — DAY 1 — DIAPERS (PRISTINE / SLIGHTLY DAMAGED)
Mail man: Good morning! I'm looking for Jonas.
Jonas: Oh thank god! We were running out of diapers. Honey, the package is here!
Vera: YES! just in time, this was about to get ugly.
Jonas: Sorry about the mess. Our whole world is diapers and coffee these days. Where do I sign?
-> Mail man: Haha, I remember those days! If you ever need a hand, I'm up for a challenge. Just sign right here.
<<jump CEn1Day1>>
-> Mailman: I see. You can sign right here and I'll be out of your way. 
<<jump CEnd1Day1>>
